# Sacramento Applied Kinesiology images: git tracks the finals, the review page, the pipeline and the review record.
# The saved copy of the client's preview site (site/) is not published here; it lives on the client's own GitHub Pages.
# Everything else (raw renders, rejects, round variants, review crops, mirrors, screenshots, the rejected first set)
# stays on the machine that made it (~3.8 GB). See README.md.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/index.html
!/README.md
!/*.py
!/*.mjs
!/*.mts
!/package.json
!/package-lock.json
!/jobs*.json
!/shotlist*.json
!/plates*_jobs.json
!/bakeoff-jobs.json
!/hf-openapi.json
!/renders.log
!/renders2.log
!/final_v2/
!/page_v2/
!/audit_v2/
/audit_v2/crops/
/audit_v2/*.py
!/audit/
/audit/crops/
!/v2/
/v2/*/
/v2/*.jpg
/v2/*.png
!/compare/
/compare/out/
/compare/*.jpg
__pycache__/
